      "name": "MagTuning – Make Mags Better",
      "slug": "magtuning-make-mags-better",
      "teaser": "🧲 MagTuning – Make Mags Better\r\nThis mod tweaks mags in SPT so they don’t suck as much.\r\n\r\nSimple. Fast. Tunable. 💥",
      "thumbnail": "",
      "downloads": 3610,
      "favourites_count": 5,
      "description": "<h1>🧲 MagTuning – Make Mags Better</h1>\n<p>This mod tweaks mags in SPT so they don’t suck as much.</p>\n<p>Simple. Fast. Tunable. 💥</p>\n<h2>🔧 What It Does</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>🔫 Fixes weird mag ergonomics (flips negatives or adds points)</li>\n<li>🏃‍♂️ Speeds up reload/check time (or makes it less painful)</li>\n<li>📦 Lets you <strong>double mag size</strong> (if you want to go full chad)</li>\n<li>🛠️ Easy config to turn stuff on/off or change values</li>\n<li>🐛 Debug mode if you want to see what’s changing</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🤔 Why?</h2>\n<p>Some mags feel like garbage. This helps.</p>\n<p>You’re welcome. 😎</p>\n<h2>📁 How to Use</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>🧩 Drop the <strong>MagTuning</strong> folder into user/mods</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>✏️ Open config.json to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ Turn features on/off</li>\n<li>🔢 Set adjustment amounts</li>\n<li>🚀 Double mag capacity</li>\n<li>🐞 Toggle debug logging</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>📝 Notes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ Works with SPT-AKI 3.11.x</li>\n<li>🧼 Safe to use — only edits stat values</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Try the defaults — they’re nice. Or break the game. I won’t judge.</p>\n<p>Have fun. 🎯</p>\n",
